  "description": "A corner that yields NO braking metric on any pass \u2014 the shape a mis-fitted braking zone takes, and the residual risk the controller's null-is-no-evidence rule accepts. The braking element never becomes quorum-ready, because corner 3 never accumulates evidence, so it STALLS at full salience and emits no events at all. A stall, not a false fade: the failure is in the conservative direction and is visible in the logs as an element with no fade events while the other two traverse normally.",
